# Preview B — the count follows you to the Lock Screen.
# Re-cut 2026-09-09 (App Review round 2): full-bleed, no bezel. Points from a contact
# sheet of the take. Two things the sheet showed that are worth knowing before the next
# re-record: the simulator's Live Activity stops ticking about a minute after Start and
# reads "2:––" a minute after that, so the usable Lock Screen stretch is the first ~26 s
# after locking; and with the time override in force the Lock Screen reads "Sat Jan 1",
# so this take was made with battery and bars overridden and the clock left real.
appearance dark
seg  ../rec/b-lock-screen.mov  3.0   5.5    # resting
seg  ../rec/b-lock-screen.mov  5.5   11.5   # Start, 0:00 → 0:06
seg  ../rec/b-lock-screen.mov  35.0  43.0   # the Lock Screen, Live Activity ticking
seg  ../rec/b-lock-screen.mov  43.0  48.5   # still ticking, under the closing card
card b1  0.0   7.5
card b2  8.0   10.8
card b3  11.3  16.5
card b5  17.0  20.5
